 **Data Structures:**
-The method operates on the standard 3DGS representation: a set of $N$ Gaussians, each defined by position $\mathbf{\mu}$, covariance $\mathbf{\Sigma}$ (or rotation $\mathbf{R}$ and scale $\mathbf{s}$), opacity $\alpha$, and spherical harmonics coefficients for color $\mathbf{c}$.
