 ## Subtopics
 
-### GaussCtrl
-GaussCtrl is a variant focusing on multi-view consistent editing [S1]. It employs ControlNet [84] for depth-conditioned editing on rendered images from the original 3DGS and uses attention-based latent code alignment to ensure geometry and appearance consistency [S1]. It is chosen when multi-view consistency is the primary constraint, differing from TIP-Editor's LoRA-based personalization [S1].
+### [GaussCtrl](14877-gaussctrl.md)
