 ## Operating characteristics
-TIP-Editor achieves superior quality compared to baselines like Instruct-N2N and DreamEditor [S1]. On comparative metrics, TIP-Editor achieved a CLIPdir score of 15.5, DINOsim of 39.5, Votequality of 70.8, and Votealignment of 81.2 [S1]. The method leverages 3DGS for fast rendering and integrates InfEdit [155] for rapid processing, suggesting a balance between editing speed and quality [S1]. Specific time and memory complexities are not given in the sources.
